+// Included by launcher_imgui.cpp (inside its anonymous namespace) right before
+// draw_mods(), so it can use the launcher's own helpers (px, col, imcol,
+// ui_text, begin_panel, eyebrow, change_mod_feature, draw_mod_feature_option).
+//
+// The Enhancements page is DATA DRIVEN: it walks the mod provider's features
+// and presents each one the way kCcRows describes (section, plain-language name
+// and description in English and Portuguese, which option to show inline).
+// A feature that is not in kCcRows still appears, under "Other", with the
+// provider's own name and text, so a new mod is never hidden by this page.
+#pragma once
